        "title": "fix(migrate-claude): use truncateUtf16Safe for skill description truncation",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nOne `.slice(0, 180)` truncation site in the migrate-claude extension may cut UTF-16 surrogate pairs in half when the skill description contains multi-byte characters such as emoji.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `extensions/migrate-claude/skills.ts`: replace `description.slice(0, 180)` with `truncateUtf16Safe(description, 180)`.\n\nLabel: bugfix | merge-risk: 🟢 minimal",
